  owner: pm-vitestredirect
  negative_control: "The same real public-handler probes fail against installed4.1.11 and pass against4.1.12: synthetic URL injection changes a child-only sentinel; backslash redirect escapes are registered before the patch. Unusual export names and asynchronous rebinding plus allowed redirect are legitimate controls. The captured original hosted OSV receipt independently reports both affected-version advisories."
